   "body": "Droid custom models written by magpie missed `reasoningEffort`, so Droid clamped sessions to `none`.\n\nThe branch adds `reasoningEffort` to `droidEntry` and sets it from the model's first advertised reasoning level in `droidEntriesAt`.\n\n[fix/2773-droid-magpie-written-custom-models](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/2773-droid-magpie-written-custom-models), commit f95c87e6d5108d4d7792e52ea3a1584ab85c82f5\n\nTests run: TestDroidEntriesExposeReasoningEffort fails before the change (reasoningEffort nil) and passes after; `go build ./...` and `go vet ./internal/agent/` pass.\n\nThis is a fork branch ready for review.\n",
